 MOQ
 ======================================================================== -->
<section id="moq" class="sec bg-white" data-section="content">
 <div class="container-wide">
 <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
 <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic tracking-tighter mb-4">
 Minimum Order <span class="text-brandOrange">Quantity</span>
 </h2>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed speakable">
 MOQ is set by one question: whose design is it, and does it need a new mold? In-stock ODM starts at 500 units; a full OEM program with new tooling starts at 3,000.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8 rounded-xl">
 <table class="w-full text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
 <thead class="bg-brandBlue text-white">
 <tr>
 <th class="text-left p-4 font-black uppercase rounded-l-lg">Order type</th>
 <th class="text-left p-4 font-black uppercase">Who owns the design</th>
 <th class="text-left p-4 font-black uppercase rounded-r-lg">MOQ</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
 <tr><td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800">In-stock ODM — your logo and color, stock packaging</td><td class="p-4 text-slate-600">WOWOHCOOL platform product</td><td class="p-4 font-black text-brandBlue">500</td></tr>
 <tr><td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800">ODM development — platform rework, stock packaging kept</td><td class="p-4 text-slate-600">WOWOHCOOL platform, adapted</td><td class="p-4 font-black text-brandBlue">1,000</td></tr>
 <tr><td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800">ODM development — custom branded box</td><td class="p-4 text-slate-600">WOWOHCOOL platform, adapted</td><td class="p-4 font-black text-brandBlue">2,000</td></tr>
 <tr><td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800">ODM development — structure or appearance changes</td><td class="p-4 text-slate-600">WOWOHCOOL platform, adapted</td><td class="p-4 font-black text-brandBlue">2,000</td></tr>
 <tr><td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800">Full OEM — your drawings or sample, new mold</td><td class="p-4 text-slate-600">Your design IP</td><td class="p-4 font-black text-brandBlue">3,000+</td></tr>
 </tbody>
 </table>
 </div>

 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Logo technique also sets a floor: laser engraving holds at <strong>500</strong>, one-colour silk screen needs <strong>1,000</strong>, and full-colour UV printing needs <strong>3,000</strong>.</p>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">For how MOQ interacts with tooling ownership and IP, see <a href="/blog/oem-vs-odm-guide/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline font-bold">OEM vs ODM</a>.</p>
 </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================================================================
 PRICING
 ======================================================================== -->
<section id="pricing" class="sec bg-slate-50" data-section="pricing">
 <div class="container-wide">
 <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
 <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic tracking-tighter mb-4">
 FOB Shenzhen <span class="text-brandOrange">Pricing</span>
 </h2>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed speakable">
 We quote FOB Shenzhen in USD. Prices fall 10–18% at 5,000+ units, and factory-direct pricing runs 20–40% below what a trading company quotes for the same product.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
 <div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200">
 <p class="text-badge font-black text-brandOrangeDeep uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Volume</p>
 <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Tiered pricing drops <strong>10–18%</strong> at 5,000+ units. Orders between 2,000 and 4,000 units receive a proportional step.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200">
 <p class="text-badge font-black text-brandOrangeDeep uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Factory vs trader</p>
 <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Buying direct runs <strong>20–40% below</strong> trading-company quotes. We are the manufacturing entity, not an intermediary.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200">
 <p class="text-badge font-black text-brandOrangeDeep uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Cost drivers</p>
 <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Cells are <strong>35–50% of BOM</strong>. Laser or silk-screen branding adds <strong>$0.30–0.80/unit</strong>; a retractable cable adds <strong>$1–2</strong>.</p>
 </div>
 </div>

 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Per-model price tables live on the product pages for <a href="/products/gan-charger/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline font-bold">GaN chargers</a>, <a href="/products/power-bank/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline font-bold">power banks</a>, <a href="/products/wireless-charger/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline font-bold">wireless chargers</a> and <a href="/products/car-charger/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline font-bold">car chargers</a>.</p>
 <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">All prices exclude shipping, duties and certification fees. Duty and VAT are a separate calculation — see <a href="/blog/import-costs-guide/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline font-bold">import costs</a>.</p>
 </div>
</section>

