 Payment <span class="text-brandOrange">Terms</span>
 </h2>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed speakable">
 First orders run on 30% deposit and 70% before shipment by T/T. After three completed orders we can move to net-30, and orders above $50,000 can be settled by letter of credit.
 </p>
 </div>

