 <tr><td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800">Repeat order (after three orders)</td><td class="p-4 text-slate-600">30/70, or net-30</td></tr>
 <tr><td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800">Letter of credit</td><td class="p-4 text-slate-600">Available on orders above <strong>$50,000</strong></td></tr>
 <tr><td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800">First-order protection</td><td class="p-4 text-slate-600">Alibaba Trade Assurance on request</td></tr>
