 Warranty &amp; <span class="text-brandOrange">Claims</span>
 </h2>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed speakable">
 Warranty runs by product line, not by negotiation: 12 months on power banks and wireless chargers, 24 months on GaN and car chargers — twice the 12 months most factories offer.
 </p>
