 <ul class="text-slate-600 text-sm space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 max-w-3xl">
 <li>The clock starts on the date of delivery.</li>
 <li>Claims require photographic or video evidence and are processed within <strong>15 business days</strong>.</li>
 <li>Our after-sales team responds to quality issues within <strong>{RT}</strong>.</li>
 <li>Confirmed manufacturing defects are settled by replacement units or a credit on your next order.</li>
 <li>Modified, disassembled or out-of-specification use is not covered.</li>
 </ul>

 <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-6">The same terms are stated in our <a href="/terms-of-service/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline font-bold">Terms of Service</a>. Quality metrics behind the defect rate are in the <a href="#quality" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline font-bold">Quality section</a> below.</p>
 </div>
</section>

