 LEAD TIME
 ======================================================================== -->
<section id="lead-time" class="sec bg-slate-50" data-section="content">
 <div class="container-wide">
 <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
 <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic tracking-tighter mb-4">
 Lead <span class="text-brandOrange">Time</span>
 </h2>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed speakable">
 In-stock ODM production takes 25–35 days. Custom packaging pushes that to 35–45, structural changes to 35–50, and a program with brand-new tooling takes 2–4 months end to end.
 </p>
 </div>

