 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-6">Door to door for an in-stock 500-unit order to the EU runs about <strong>10–12 weeks</strong>: 1–2 weeks sample, 4–5 weeks production, 4–5 weeks sea freight.</p>
