<!-- ========================================================================
 QUALITY
 ======================================================================== -->
<section id="quality" class="sec bg-white" data-section="content">
 <div class="container-wide">
 <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
 <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic tracking-tighter mb-4">
 Quality <span class="text-brandOrange">Behind the Terms</span>
 </h2>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed speakable">
 Every unit passes four inspection stages and a 100% four-hour aging test. Outgoing defect rate runs below 0.3% against an industry 2–5%, and on-time delivery is above 97%.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
 <div class="p-8 bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200">
 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3">Four-stage inspection</h3>
 <ul class="text-slate-600 text-sm space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
 <li><strong>IQC</strong> — incoming cells, ICs, PCBs, connectors, casing</li>
 <li><strong>IPQC</strong> — in-process soldering, component placement, wiring</li>
 <li><strong>FQC</strong> — charging performance, ports, buttons, LED</li>
 <li><strong>OQC</strong> — packaging, accessories, labelling before shipment</li>
 </ul>
 </div>
 <div class="p-8 bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200">
 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3">Measured performance</h3>
 <ul class="text-slate-600 text-sm space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
 <li>Aging test: <strong>100% 4-hour</strong> (industry: batch sampling 2-hour)</li>
 <li>AQL: <strong>0.65 normal / 0.25 tightened</strong></li>
 <li>Production yield: <strong>&gt;98%</strong></li>
 <li>On-time delivery: <strong>&gt;97%</strong></li>
 </ul>
 </div>
 </div>

 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Third-party inspection by SGS, Bureau Veritas or TÜV Rheinland can be arranged on request, typically <strong>$300–800 per inspection</strong>, and we hold <strong>47 Qi2-certified products</strong>.</p>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">For how a buyer verifies any of this independently, see the <a href="/blog/factory-verification-checklist/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline font-bold">factory verification checklist</a>.</p>
 </div>
</section>

